# ui_hub.md

This document defines the **Hub UI systems** for *Purge of the Crescent Veil*.

**Note:** All systems are modular and self-contained. See [docs/modular/game_system_tree.md](../modular/game_system_tree.md) for the latest status. A system remains **In-Progress** until its documentation, cleanup, and tests are merged and verified.


---

## Hub UI Elements

- Chapter selection menu
- Faction reputation display
- Hub station access
- Vendors
    - Reputation-based item availability
    - Alignment-reactive offerings
- Crafting terminals
    - Crafting terminals
    - Rites / Powers crafting (planned)
    - Weapon mod crafting
    - Cosmetic crafting
- Arena/Challenge access
- Story progression terminal
- Achievements display

---

## Planned Features

- Hub visual state reflects current alignment and faction standing.
- Faction reputation and alignment should influence vendor inventory.
- Hub menu overlay highlights dominant alignment and faction when opened.
